---
// Footer.astro - 页脚组件，参考 Semantic UI 底部风格
---

<footer class="footer">
  <!-- 上半部分：白色背景三栏 -->
  <div class="footer-columns">
    <div class="container columns-inner">
      <div class="col">
        <h4>导航</h4>
        <a href="/">首页</a>
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅</a>
        <a href="#">归档</a>
        <a href="#">标签</a>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h4>社交</h4>
        <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitter / X</a>
        <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">掘金</a>
        <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">知乎</a>
      </div>
      <div class="col col-about">
        <h4>关于本站</h4>
        <p>一个专注于前端开发与技术探索的个人博客。在这里分享编程心得、项目实践和学习笔记，希望能对你有所帮助。</p>
        <p class="tech-stack">技术栈：Astro + TypeScript</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- 下半部分：灰色背景居中 -->
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container bottom-inner">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} 我的博客 · 使用 <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a> 构建</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  /* 上半部分 - 三栏区域 */
  .footer-columns {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 3rem 0;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .columns-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: var(--layout-max-width);
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex: 0 0 18%;
  }

  .col-about {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: none;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .col h4 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .col a {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .col a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .col-about {
    max-width: 280px;
  }

  .col-about p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tech-stack {
    margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
    font-size: 0.8125rem !important;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* 下半部分 - 灰色底栏 */
  .footer-bottom {
    background-color: var(--color-footer-bg, #e8e8e8);
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .bottom-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bottom-inner p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bottom-inner a {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .bottom-inner a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .columns-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
